[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "――マナの恵みをもたらす白きほうき星が\nやって来なくなったわけについて、私たちは調べたわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "結果、私たちの文明を滅ぼした赤のほうき星こそが\n白きほうき星の、変わり果てた姿なのだと気付いたの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "――白きほうき星の多くが赤のほうき星へと変心し、\n星々の生命を喰らう災厄となって星系を回遊していた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "白きほうき星の恵みは、ほぼ途絶えてしまった。\n……これは私たちにとって、計算外の事態だったの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "私たちは、マナの代替になる資源を\n青の星で見つけることもできなかった",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "それで、ランターナ王国はマナの枯渇に対応できず、\n錬金術を見限ってしまったわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "白きほうき星の恵みは復活しない……だけど、\n人類の繁栄に錬金術は必要と、そう私たちは判断した",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "だから、黄金星に大量に眠っているマナを\n供給しようと考えたの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "でも、私たちは歴史の表舞台に出るわけにはいかない。\nそれに安易に分け与えても良い影響が出るとは思えない",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "そこで考えたのよ。人類が自力でこの地にたどり着き、\nマナの結晶を手に入れればいいと",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "こうして生み出されたのが、「救世主計画」よ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "「救世主計画」は、一人の錬金術士により、\nマナが豊富に眠る土地が発見されるというもの――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "だから果ての大陸の噂話を再度流したわ。それはかつて\n流布した噂を媒介に、各地の宝島伝説と混じり合った",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "一人の錬金術士が、その数少ない手掛かりから、\n仲間たちと手を取り合って果ての大陸へたどり着き――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "偉大なる錬金術士の名声と共に、\nマナが行き渡り、失われた錬金術が再興される",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "そして可能ならば、\nマナに代わる資源を見つけ、人類の救世主となる――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "その救世主役には、これからの世を生きる人類で\n誰よりも錬金術に素養がある者が妥当だろうと考えたわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "それが――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "レスナ、あなたよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]